      "content": "living with it doesn't feel like living, though. it just feels like waiting for something to end. i look at the clock at work and i realize i'm spending my whole life just waiting to be allowed to sleep so i can do it all again. it's just a slow death by repetition. i don't want to \"find ways to make it bearable,\" i just want the noise to stop. i want to actually be in charge of my own ending for once, instead of just being used up by this place.",
